@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@adminKey = <set-a-private-local-key>
@traceId = <trace-uuid>

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ready

### Find a trace and its spans
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/traces/{{traceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

### Read recent audit records
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/audit?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

### Create a scoped API key (response contains the raw key once)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "local-test",
  "scopes": ["admin:read"]
}

### Revoke an API key
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/api-keys/<api-key-uuid>
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}
